{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d1_1-012-introduction-to-civil-engineering-_calendar","statement":"Week 11 of 1.012 has no lecture class, a Design Project 3 - Coat Stand build lab, and the key date to hand in the Final Coat Stand Design.","source_span":"11\nNo Class\nDesign Project 3 - Coat Stand:\nBuild\nHand in Final Coat Stand Design"}
